        "nobel_worthiness": "The Higgs boson discovery completed a central test of the Standard Model and required an exceptional experimental effort.",
        "attribution": "Gianotti and Virdee represent leadership of ATLAS and CMS, but the discovery depended on thousands of contributors and shared work across both experiments.",
        "maturity": "The particle's existence and properties have been confirmed across many measurements since 2012.",
        "uncertainties": [
