        "attribution": "Halzen was central to the scientific case and leadership; Karle and Spiering represent key detector development and experimental leadership.",
        "maturity": "The astrophysical neutrino signal has been established with accumulating data, though source identification remains an active area.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The discovery and construction involved a large international collaboration, complicating individual attribution.",
          "The eventual astrophysical interpretation of the diffuse flux is still developing."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
